        "give :parameters (?giver ?receiver - character ?object - (either character item) ?place - location) :precondition (and (not (= ?giver ?receiver)) (at ?giver ?place) (at ?receiver ?place) (alive ?receiver) (alive ?giver) (has ?giver ?object) (not (has ?receiver ?object)) (intends-has ?giver ?receiver ?object)) :effect (and (has ?receiver ?object) (not (has ?giver ?object))))": "(:action give :parameters (?giver ?receiver - character ?object - (either character item) ?place - location) :precondition (and (not (= ?giver ?receiver)) (at ?giver ?place) (at ?receiver ?place) (alive ?receiver) (alive ?giver) (has ?giver ?object) (not (has ?receiver ?object)) (intends-has ?giver ?receiver ?object)) :effect (and (has ?receiver ?object) (not (has ?giver ?object))))",
