        "summon :parameters (?summoner - person ?g - ismagic ?thing - (either character item) ?location - location) :precondition (and (confined ?g) (magic ?thing) (at ?summoner ?location) (has ?summoner ?thing) (in ?g ?thing) (alive ?summoner) (not (= ?summoner ?g)) (magic-char ?g) (magic-char-alive)) :effect (and (at ?g ?location) (controls ?summoner ?g ?thing) (controls-magic ?summoner ?thing) (not (in ?g ?thing)) (not (confined ?g))))": "(:action summon :parameters (?summoner - person ?g - ismagic ?thing - (either character item) ?location - location) :precondition (and (confined ?g) (magic ?thing) (at ?summoner ?location) (has ?summoner ?thing) (in ?g ?thing) (alive ?summoner) (not (= ?summoner ?g)) (magic-char ?g) (magic-char-alive)) :effect (and (at ?g ?location) (controls ?summoner ?g ?thing) (controls-magic ?summoner ?thing) (not (in ?g ?thing)) (not (confined ?g))))",
